2.  **Visible Scrollbars**: Replaced the `scrollbar-hide` class with `custom-scrollbar` across the **Agent Sidebar**, **Chat Interface**, and **Apps Library**. This ensures users can visually see their scroll position and interact with the scrollbar on desktop devices.
3.  **Layout & Z-Index Fixes**:
    *   Wrapped the Apps Library in a **Portal** (rendering at `document.body`) to completely solve z-index clipping issues with the sidebar or main header.
    *   Ensured the "Done" footer in the Apps Library doesn't overlap the last row of apps by managing the flex container properly.
4.  **Agent Sidebar Scrolling**: Fixed the "Agent Header" issue by ensuring the header remains sticky/fixed while only the list of agents scrolls.

